      "name": "ProcessDataPacket",
      "signature": "void ProcessDataPacket(char * pDataBuffer, uint bufferSize)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4",
      "comment": "Processes and validates a binary data packet with callback invocation.\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. Validates packet size >= 8 bytes (minimum header)\\n2. Extracts packet fields: byte at offset 1, width at offset 4, height at offset 2/6\\n3. Checks if all dimension fields zero - resets global state if so\\n4. Validates height field >= 0xc (12 bytes minimum)\\n5. Updates global buffer size if height differs from current\\n6. Calculates total required size: width + height\\n7. Verifies global buffer has capacity for required data\\n8. Copies packet data into global buffer using dword then byte copies\\n9. Updates global position counter\\n10. If buffer capacity reached, invokes optional pre-processing callback\\n11. Loops through processing items: extracts count and height from buffer\\n12. Validates item parameters: count < 0x100, height < 0x10, calculated size valid\\n13. For each valid item block, invokes packet handler callback with dimensions\\n14. Decrements buffer position and continues until buffer exhausted\\n15. Resets buffer position to zero on completion\\n16. Returns 1 on success, 0 on validation failure\\n\\nParameters:\\n- pPacket (ECX): Pointer to binary packet data with header and payload\\n- packetSize (EDX): Size of packet data in bytes\\n\\nReturns:\\n- 1 if packet processed successfully, 0 if validation failed\\n\\nSpecial Cases:\\n- Packet size < 8 returns immediate failure\\n- All zero dimensions trigger state reset with callback invocation\\n- Height < 0xc returns failure (minimum size requirement)\\n- Insufficient buffer space returns failure\\n- Callback pointers may be null; operations skipped if null\\n\\nGlobals Used:\\n- DAT_6fa2b240: Global data buffer (destination for packet payload)\\n- DAT_6fa2b238: Current buffer position/size tracker\\n- DAT_6fa2b23c: Current offset within buffer\\n- DAT_6fa2b22c: Packet handler callback pointer\\n- DAT_6fa2b230: Pre-processing callback pointer",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "API",
      "index": "API:3312e111d1d75bcd2b0522bedf817998",
