      "name": "HandleSecurityFailure",
      "signature": "void HandleSecurityFailure(int errorType)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Displays runtime security failure message and exits the application.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize stack canary XOR value for buffer overflow detection\n2. Check if custom security handler is registered at 0x6fa2adac\n3. If custom handler exists, invoke it with error type parameter and jump to exit\n4. Select error message based on errorType parameter (1=buffer overrun, other=unknown security error)\n5. Retrieve executable module name using GetModuleFileNameA API\n6. Fallback to \"<program_name_unknown>\" if GetModuleFileNameA returns 0\n7. Validate module name length; truncate with \"...\" if exceeds 60 character limit\n8. Allocate stack buffer for error message construction\n9. Build composite error message by concatenating:\n   - Base error message (selected by error type)\n   - Newline separator (0x6fa28628)\n   - Program line prefix with module name\n   - Newline separator\n   - Detailed error description (selected by error type)\n10. Display message box with title \"Microsoft Visual C++ Runtime Library\" and MB_YESNO (0x12010)\n11. Exit process with code 3 via __exit()\n\nParameters:\nerrorType (int) - Determines which security error message to display:\n  1 = Buffer overrun detected (\"A buffer overrun has been detected...\")\n  other = Unknown security failure (\"A security error of unknown cause...\")\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Never returns, always calls __exit(3) to terminate process\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- GetModuleFileNameA failure: Uses hardcoded \"<program_name_unknown>\" fallback\n- Module name length validation: Maximum 0x3c (60) characters including trailing \"...\"\n- Custom handler redirect: If 0x6fa2adac is non-null, bypasses all message display\n- Stack canary protection: XOR value computed at 0x6fa2a6c0 for buffer overflow detection\n- Message construction: Uses strcpy_optimized for efficient string concatenation\n- Exit behavior: Always terminates with exit code 3, never returns to caller",
      "name_source": "LoD/PD2",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:9edd5270653ada86eeecdcb3502d3803",
